Iipd0 vpd0 0 dc 1n
Iipd1 vpd1 0 dc 1n
Iipd2 vpd2 0 dc 1n
Iipd3 vpd3 0 dc 1n
EonSense onSense 0 xpix2x2.xpix[0].ON 0 1
EnrstSense nrstSense 0 xpix2x2.xpix[0].nRst 0 1
EvdiffSense vdiffSense 0 xpix2x2.xpix[0].vdiff 0 1
xpix2x2 0 pixrst 0 pixrst 0 0 0 0 vpd3 vpd2 vpd1 vpd0 VddA18 0 0 OnBn OffBn DiffBn PrSFBp RefrBp PrBp openDVS_pixel2x2
* RESET_ROW_END
* coupling injection on PrBp after reset release: aggressor edges (rise 10 ms, fall 25 ms) through Cc into the bias line load CL
CL PrBp 0 50p
Cc agg PrBp 7f
Vagg agg 0 PWL(0 0 10m 0 10.00001m 1.8 25m 1.8 25.00001m 0 40m 0)
EvprSense vprSense 0 xpix2x2.xpix[0].vpr 0 1
EvsfSense vsfSense 0 xpix2x2.xpix[0].vsf 0 1
.save v(PrBp) v(vprSense) v(vsfSense) v(vdiffSense) v(onSense) v(nrstSense) v(pixrst)
.tran 2u 40m 0 2u
.control
run
meas tran prbp_ref FIND v(PrBp) AT=9.9m
meas tran vpr_ref FIND v(vprSense) AT=9.9m
meas tran vsf_ref FIND v(vsfSense) AT=9.9m
meas tran vdiff_ref FIND v(vdiffSense) AT=9.9m
meas tran vdiff_at_2m FIND v(vdiffSense) AT=2m
meas tran vdiff_at_5m FIND v(vdiffSense) AT=5m
meas tran on_before MAX v(onSense) from=1.1m to=9.9m
meas tran prbp_max MAX v(PrBp) from=10m to=25m
meas tran prbp_min MIN v(PrBp) from=25m to=40m
meas tran vpr_max MAX v(vprSense) from=10m to=40m
meas tran vpr_min MIN v(vprSense) from=10m to=40m
meas tran vsf_max MAX v(vsfSense) from=10m to=40m
meas tran vsf_min MIN v(vsfSense) from=10m to=40m
meas tran vdiff_max MAX v(vdiffSense) from=10m to=40m
meas tran vdiff_min MIN v(vdiffSense) from=10m to=40m
meas tran on_after MAX v(onSense) from=10m to=40m
meas tran vdiff_at_10p1m FIND v(vdiffSense) AT=10.1m
meas tran vdiff_at_11m FIND v(vdiffSense) AT=11m
meas tran vdiff_at_15m FIND v(vdiffSense) AT=15m
quit
.endc
.end
